{
 "_note": "Widget and dynamic-tag vocabulary contributed by a client's own WordPress plugin. Kept out of elementor-registry.json on purpose: that file is regenerated wholesale by build_registry_php.py from the Elementor source tree, so anything hand-added there is lost on the next remine. Entries here are merged in at load time by core.Registry and are additive only — a name that already exists in the mined registry is never overwritten. Controls are read off the plugin's register_controls(), never guessed; `_common` expands to the 112 shared element controls so a widget can still carry margin, padding and responsive visibility.",
 "_plugins": {
